        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1956–57 Iraq FA Cup Championship\n- Places: Baghdad\n- Topics: Tournament eligibility, population rankings\n\nFacts:\n- The 1956–57 Iraq FA Cup Championship was open only to teams from Baghdad, unlike the previous season.\n- As of 2016, Baghdad had an approximate population of 8,765,000.\n- As of 2016, Baghdad was the largest city in Iraq.\n- As of 2016, Baghdad was the second largest city in the Arab world after Cairo.\n- As of 2016, Baghdad was the second largest city in Western Asia after Tehran.",
